
  pipe (xlate0 stall 1000 debug 0 )
   o: faninany |
      spec 1-* 4 |
      console ?

      < count1.njp |
      -- remove all punctuation characters |
      xlate *-* 7B-7E _ |
      xlate *-* 21-2F _ |
      xlate *-* 3A-3F _ |
      xlate *-* 5B-60 _ |
      translate *-* 5F 20 |
      space 1 |
      strip both blank |
      o:

